<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?>
<class name="AttributeSet" inherits="Resource" api_type="extension" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot/master/doc/class.xsd">
	<brief_description>
		Resource holding named numeric attributes and their derived current values.
	</brief_description>
	<description>
		Base values are authored in the editor as a name to value dictionary; current values are derived at runtime from the base plus every active modifier.
		The formula is [code](base + sum of ADD) * product of MULTIPLY[/code], and a single [code]OVERRIDE[/code] wins over all of it.
		Override [code]_pre_attribute_change[/code] to clamp a value before it is written, and [code]_post_attribute_change[/code] to react after it is. From C#, connect to the signals instead - C# cannot inherit GDExtension classes.
	</description>
